<h3 id="Appendix-2-%7C-Advanced-search-box-to-update-a-substance-in-the-simulation"><strong>Appendix 2</strong> | <em>Advanced search box to update a substance in the simulation</em><a class="anchor-link" href="#Appendix-2-%7C-Advanced-search-box-to-update-a-substance-in-the-simulation">¶</a></h3><blockquote>
<p>With a little more effort, we can rearrange the text and the image side by side.</p>
<p>We can populate the new molecule so-called <code>m2</code> to the collection of substances in the notebook with <code>mysubstances["m2"] = tox</code></p>
</blockquote>
